## Inclusions (Page 4)

Testing will be comprehensive, covering the full spectrum of application quality.

**Testing Dimensions Covered:**
1. **Functional Validation:** Verification of business logic, requirement traceability, and defined use cases. (What the system *does*).
2. **Integration Testing:** Validation of data flow, API communication, and interaction between microservices. (How components *talk*).
3. **Security Testing:** Validation of authorization mechanisms (Role-Based Access Control) and data encryption protocols. (How the system is *protected*).
4. **Performance Testing:** Verification of speed, scalability, and stability under defined load scenarios (response time, throughput). (How the system *performs*).
5. **Usability Testing (UX):** Verification of ease of use, navigational flow, clarity of error messages, and adherence to UI/UX standards. (How the system is *used*).

